    <description><![CDATA[## Perplexity

Perplexity is an AI-powered search engine and answer engine that provides instant, accurate answers with cited sources. It combines the power of large language models with real-time web search to give you comprehensive, up-to-date responses.

## Features

- **AI-Powered Search**: Ask questions in natural language and get direct answers
- **Cited Sources**: Every answer includes references so you can verify information
- **Follow-up Questions**: Dig deeper with contextual follow-up questions
- **Real-Time Information**: Access up-to-date web content for current events
- **Focus Modes**: Search across the web, academic papers, YouTube, Reddit, and more
- **Collections**: Organize your research into collections
- **Perplexity Pro**: Enhanced features with access to GPT-4, Claude, and other frontier models

## Installation

This package installs the Perplexity desktop application for Windows (x64).

---

#### [choco://perplexity](choco://perplexity)
To use choco:// protocol URLs, install [(unofficial) choco:// Protocol support](https://chocolatey.org/packages/choco-protocol-support)

### Package-specific issue
